# Prospect Map

- Black theme only: `#050506` background, three surfaces, hairline `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` borders.
- One accent: electric cyan, used sparingly. Tiers: High emerald, Mid amber, Least slate.
- Inter for UI. Mono (JetBrains Mono) for numbers and scores.
- Design tokens live in `app/globals.css`. Do not invent one-off colors in features.
- LLM access only via `/lib/llm`. Never call model APIs from UI or route handlers.
- AI matching and research run as background jobs (`lib/agents`), not during render.
- Auth is last. Do not add login, sessions, or user models until that phase.
- Map style is built in `lib/geo/mapStyle.ts` (Protomaps black flavor). Tile source is env-configured.
- Keep feature logic in `features/*`. Phase 0 has no product logic.
